{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 1382,
 "dur": 46.041,
 "target": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Zib's white cat walked out of his new cottage completely black.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.054
  },
  {
   "text": "Zib, an alien, had built the chimney teacup-tall. \"Short and sweet!\" So why are real chimneys so tall?",
   "s": 3.254,
   "e": 8.146
  },
  {
   "text": "He lit his first fire. The smoke ignored the chimney and filled the kitchen.",
   "s": 8.446,
   "e": 11.9
  },
  {
   "text": "Duchess the cat had one dream: being the whitest cat in Puddleford. Gone in four seconds.",
   "s": 12.101,
   "e": 16.408
  },
  {
   "text": "So Zib opened the windows. Smoke poured out of all six, like a steam train in a hat.",
   "s": 16.608,
   "e": 20.712
  },
  {
   "text": "Mrs. Fig next door waved at it and tried to buy a ticket.",
   "s": 20.912,
   "e": 23.659
  },
  {
   "text": "So Zib made the chimney even shorter. \"Short and sweet!\"",
   "s": 23.859,
   "e": 26.44
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the wind rolled over the roof and stuffed the smoke right back down, out the mail slot.",
   "s": 26.56,
   "e": 29.773
  },
  {
   "text": "So what's a tall chimney for?",
   "s": 29.973,
   "e": 31.056
  },
  {
   "text": "Hot smoke is light. It wants to rise.",
   "s": 31.356,
   "e": 32.944
  },
  {
   "text": "A tall chimney is a tall tube of hot air, and it pulls like a straw.",
   "s": 33.344,
   "e": 36.596
  },
  {
   "text": "Its top pokes above the roof, where wind can't push the smoke back in.",
   "s": 36.796,
   "e": 39.87
  },
  {
   "text": "Zib built it tall. Duchess spent a week licking herself white.",
   "s": 40.07,
   "e": 42.771
  },
  {
   "text": "And now his flying saucer parks on top.",
   "s": 42.971,
   "e": 44.741
  }
 ],
